maak (0.18.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The generated Zed task file is kept in step with the Maak file:
    contrib/zed/maak-zed sync writes it after an edit and watch writes it
    whenever the file changes.  The generated file carries the watch as a task
    of its own.

 -- Josep Bigorra <jjbigorra@gmail.com>  Tue, 10 Nov 2026 19:05:00 +0100

maak (0.17.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Editor integrations under contrib/, for Neovim, Vim, VS Code, Helix,
    IntelliJ, Zed and Sublime Text, all reading the task list from one Guile
    helper.  Every one of them can dry-run a task, and Neovim, Vim and VS Code
    repeat the last run.

 -- Josep Bigorra <jjbigorra@gmail.com>  Tue, 10 Nov 2026 18:30:00 +0100

