maak (0.15.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The Arch recipe builds: it unpacks the directory makepkg creates, fetches
    the tag from where the releases are published, and its pkgver follows the
    release instead of saying 0.12.2.
  * The suite compares every copy of the version with the program, and checks
    the guide's links and index.
  * The Debian changelog is up to date again.

